<TITLE>Oil Pump</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>An oil pump with a lightweight aluminum alloy pump cover has been adopted. The oil pump is driven by the torque converter.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The oil pump supports the B1 and B3 brakes, contributing to a lighter and more compact automatic transaxle.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
